{"about_the_game":"Gachi Defense is an incredible combination of fantasy and Gachimuchi in the genre of survival with elements of tower defense. Hordes of slaves led by Darkholme invaded the world of simple boys, in order to enslave everyone. Your goal is to hold out as long as possible, crushing every enemy that tries to get close to you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634030/extras/f8e4ed76d1655eccb01ded316ea672b5.avif?t=1768889025\" width=344 height=67 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634030/extras/d639cf6413c1096d0e0d43f5892c2eba.webp?t=1768889025\" width=620 height=35 /></span><br>The world is filled with thousands of slaves... Each of them is eager to enslave peaceful boys and turn them into their own kind. Do you think your Gachimuchi settlement is safe? Wait and pray that it does not get in the way of the Legion of the Whip!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634030/extras/27027e62c40a496a8be2927f26028eff.poster.avif?t=1768889025\" width=610 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634030/extras/27027e62c40a496a8be2927f26028eff.webm?t=1768889025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634030/extras/27027e62c40a496a8be2927f26028eff.mp4?t=1768889025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634030/extras/ef69ae58ad2b348b88264735245e036b.webp?t=1768889025\" width=620 height=35 /></span><br>Lead the hero of Gachimuchi and upgrade his abilities by defeating enemies! Build barricades, defensive towers, various traps and other structures that allow you to crush the slaves.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634030/extras/6de22fd160c3174bf64e82ece2bcdf0d.poster.avif?t=1768889025\" width=610 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634030/extras/6de22fd160c3174bf64e82ece2bcdf0d.webm?t=1768889025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634030/extras/6de22fd160c3174bf64e82ece2bcdf0d.mp4?t=1768889025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634030/extras/dd44a0f6a8a75053fcf8d5ca7b9cfdb3.webp?t=1768889025\" width=620 height=35 /></span><br>Build a gyms and set up the production of resources, improve buildings to increase their efficiency. Erect defensive structures to prevent the slaves from destroy your settlement and enslaving peaceful boys!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634030/extras/e5adf9c8d6123af2a8b0ea42fc7e454d.poster.avif?t=1768889025\" width=610 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634030/extras/e5adf9c8d6123af2a8b0ea42fc7e454d.webm?t=1768889025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634030/extras/e5adf9c8d6123af2a8b0ea42fc7e454d.mp4?t=1768889025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2634030/extras/482db72c8668a1b006bffb43e12f04af.webp?t=1768889025\" width=620 height=35 /></